### Netcup SCP API — Disks
# Disk management, driver changes, and formatting.

### List All Disks
# Returns: name, allocationInMiB, capacityInMiB, storageDriver
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/disks
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Single Disk
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/disks/REPLACE_WITH_DISK_NAME
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Supported Storage Drivers
# Returns list of supported drivers for this server's machine type
# Values: VIRTIO, VIRTIO_SCSI, IDE, SATA
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/disks/supported-drivers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Change Disk Driver (async — returns task UUID)
# Valid drivers: VIRTIO, VIRTIO_SCSI, IDE, SATA
PATCH {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/disks
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json

{
  "driver": "VIRTIO"
}

### Format Disk (DESTRUCTIVE — async — returns task UUID)
# WARNING: All data on the disk will be lost!
# Server must be in SHUTOFF state
POST {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/disks/REPLACE_WITH_DISK_NAME:format
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
